174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (The Dalton Medical BED-420 Ultra Low Long Term Care Bed combines resident safety, comfort, and versatile electric positioning in a durable, low-profile design. The bed electrically lowers to approximately 3.9" from the floor to help support safer resident care, while the stepped lowering system helps reduce foot-entrapment risk. A four-motor electrical system provides powered adjustment of the backrest, knee section, bed height, and Trendelenburg/reverse Trendelenburg positioning. Its compact sectional design allows the bed to disassemble into four sections for easier transportation and storage. Available with Cherry or Oak finish headboard and footboard to complement a variety of care environments.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [46]
>>
