/E (The Dalton Medical BED-BC337 Expandable LTC Low Bed combines flexible sizing, powered positioning, and resident-focused features for long-term care environments. Its expandable sleeping surface provides multiple width and length configurations, while the four-motor electrical system delivers smooth adjustment of the backrest, knee section, bed height, and Trendelenburg positioning. Built-in USB charging ports, underbed lighting, a staff control panel, and central locking provide added convenience and functionality for everyday resident care.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
